<view class="page detail-page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-card">正在安全读取预审资料…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{loadError && !booking}}" class="state-card"><text>{{loadError}}</text><button bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{booking}}">
    <view class="summary-card"><view><text>{{booking.vehicle ? booking.vehicle.plateNumber : '车牌待核验'}}</text><text>{{serviceModeLabel}}</text></view><text>{{booking.precheck.status === "pending" ? "待预检审核" : booking.status === "precheck_action_required" ? "等待车主处理" : "本轮已审核"}}</text><view class="summary-grid"><view><text>预约时间</text><text>{{appointmentLabel}}</text></view><view><text>支付提交</text><text>{{submittedLabel}}</text></view><view><text>联系人</text><text>{{booking.contactName}} {{booking.contactPhone}}</text></view><view><text>模拟实付</text><text>{{paymentLabel}}</text></view></view></view>
    <view class="review-note"><image src="/assets/icons/shield-check.png"/><text>请核对 {{requiredPhotoCount}} 张照片与预约车辆信息。本环节只做资料预审，不代表机动车年检结论。</text></view>
    <view class="section-head"><view><text>预约照片</text><text>{{requiredPhotoDescription}} · 点击查看原图</text></view><text>{{photoCount}} / {{requiredPhotoCount}}</text></view>
    <view class="photo-grid"><button wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="kind" class="photo-card {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}} {{!item.url ? 'missing' : ''}}" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="preview"><image wx:if="{{item.url}}" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else><image src="/assets/icons/warning-circle.png"/><text>资料缺失</text></view><text>{{item.label}}</text></button></view>
    <view class="routing-guide"><view class="guide-title"><image src="/assets/icons/shield-check.png"/><text>标注问题后，会发生什么？</text></view><view class="guide-row"><text>资料不清 / 不一致</text><text>补充或核对资料 → 再次审核</text></view><block wx:if="{{vehiclePhotosRequired}}"><view class="guide-row"><text>车身脏污</text><text>推荐附近洗车店 · 不竞价</text></view><view class="guide-row"><text>车损 / 故障灯</text><text>维修报价 → 车主选择门店</text></view><view class="guide-row"><text>普通外观问题</text><text>不直接等同于年检不合格</text></view></block><view wx:else class="guide-row"><text>现场车况</text><text>由司机取车时另行留证，不在预约预审判断</text></view><view class="guide-footer"><text>退回处理 ≠ 自动退款</text><text>订单与已付款保留，原时段释放；车主处理后重新选择本站时段。退款须由车主主动申请。</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{booking.precheck.resolutionNote}}" class="resolution-card"><text>车主本次处理说明</text><text>{{booking.precheck.resolutionNote}}</text><text>请结合更新后的 {{requiredPhotoCount}} 张资料重新核对，服务完成不代表自动通过。</text></view><view class="bottom-space"></view>
    <view wx:if="{{booking.precheck.status === 'pending'}}" class="action-bar"><button class="reject" bindtap="openReject" disabled="{{deciding}}">发现问题，待处理</button><button class="approve" bindtap="approve" loading="{{deciding}}" disabled="{{deciding}}">预审通过并接单</button></view>
    <view wx:else class="review-note">本轮预检已处理。车主补充后会重新进入预检队列。</view>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{showReject}}" class="sheet-layer">
    <view class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeReject" catchtouchmove="noop"></view>
    <view class="reject-sheet" catchtap="noop">
      <block wx:if="{{!rejectConfirming}}">
        <view class="sheet-head"><view><text>标注问题与后续处理</text><text>按问题推荐后续动作，车主自主选择</text></view><button bindtap="closeReject">关闭</button></view>
        <scroll-view scroll-y class="sheet-scroll">
          <text class="field-label">问题类型（至少一项）</text>
          <view class="reason-grid"><button wx:for="{{reasons}}" wx:key="code" class="{{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="toggleReason"><view class="reason-title"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.selected ? "已选" : "选择"}}</text></view><text class="reason-effect">{{item.effect}}</text></button></view>
          <text class="field-label">{{photoPickHint}}</text>
          <view class="photo-tags"><button wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="kind" class="{{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-kind="{{item.kind}}" bindtap="togglePhoto">{{item.label}}</button></view>
          <text class="field-label">具体说明（5–300 字）</text>
          <textarea maxlength="300" value="{{reasonText}}" bindinput="reasonInput" placeholder="{{vehiclePhotosRequired ? '请写明发现了什么、位置或现象，以及车主需要补充的材料。普通划痕不应直接作为退回依据。' : '请写明行驶证或预约信息中发现的问题，以及车主需要补充或核对的材料。'}}"/>
          <text class="count">{{reasonText.length}} / 300</text>
          <view class="refund-warning"><text>发送后的订单状态</text><text>保留订单与已付款 {{paymentLabel}} · 释放原时段 · 等待车主处理或主动申请退款</text></view>
        </scroll-view>
        <button class="confirm-reject" catchtap="submitReject" loading="{{deciding}}" disabled="{{deciding}}">发送问题处理清单</button>
      </block>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="sheet-head"><view><text>确认发送问题处理清单</text><text>将发送给车主，并释放原时段</text></view><button bindtap="closeReject" disabled="{{deciding}}">关闭</button></view>
        <view class="confirm-panel">
          <text>订单与已付款 {{paymentLabel}} 保留，原时段释放。</text>
          <text>车主可补充资料、选择洗车或维修后重新提交；是否退款由车主主动决定。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="confirm-actions">
          <button class="back-edit" catchtap="backToRejectForm" disabled="{{deciding}}">返回修改</button>
          <button class="confirm-reject" catchtap="submitReject" loading="{{deciding}}" disabled="{{deciding}}">确认发送给车主</button>
        </view>
      </block>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
